<title>USA: American Radio buy Micronet for $70.25 mln.</title>
<headline>American Radio buy Micronet for $70.25 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Radio Systems Corp said Tuesday its American Tower Systems subsidiary agreed to acquire assets of MicroNet Inc for about $70.25 million.</p>
<p>American Tower is also acquiring MicroNet's video transport operations, which transports video, voice and data by satellit and terrestrial mircowave networks.</p>
<p>Including the MicroNet acquisition, American Tower will own and manage more than 600 tower sites.</p>
<p>Micronet is an antenna site provider in the U.S.</p>
</text>
